<%# Steps to restart the LIVE app from the operator's LOCAL machine (that's
    where kamal/fly live) to apply a staged DB restore or newly-applied
    credentials. Folder name + deploy target + rails subdir come from the peer
    env synced from local (SyncConfig#peer_*). Shared by the staged-restore
    modal, the persistent staged banner, and the credential-recovery banner. %>
<% folder = restore_roe_folder_label(@sync_config) %>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-sm space-y-2">
  <li>
    Navigate to <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded-xs"><%= folder %></code> in your terminal.
    <div class="ml-5 mt-0.5">
      <a href="/documentation/guide-roe-folder" class="text-blue-600 underline text-xs">How to find your Roe folder →</a>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li>
    Once in <code class="font-mono text-xs bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded-xs"><%= folder %></code>, run this command:
    <code class="block mt-1 bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 rounded-xs px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm break-all"><%= restore_restart_command(@sync_config) %></code>
  </li>
</ol>
